      en: ["Located at the Velana International Airport.", "Supplies meals to international and regional airlines.", "Operates under strict international hygiene protocols.", "Structured as a joint venture in the aviation sector.", "Produces thousands of fresh in-flight meals every day.", "Combines Maldivian ingredients with global airline menus."]
